 "steps": [
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Peel the potato and cut it into <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"1.5\" data-s=\"0\">1.5 cm</span> cubes</b>. Cut the onion into <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"2\" data-s=\"0\">2 cm</span> squares</b>.</li><li>Halve the courgette lengthwise and cut it into <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"1\" data-s=\"0\">1 cm</span> half-moons</b>. Tear oyster mushrooms into strips or quarter button mushrooms. Mince the garlic.</li><li>Cut the tofu into <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"2\" data-s=\"0\">2 cm</span> cubes</b>. Cut the spring onion into <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"3\" data-s=\"0\">3 cm</span> lengths and slice the green pepper on the diagonal.</li><li>If using beef, cut it into <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"1.5\" data-s=\"0\">1.5 cm</span> cubes</b>, no thin slicing needed.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
