    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Add the courgette, mushrooms and garlic. Cover again and simmer for <b>4 minutes</b>, until the courgette is just tender at the edges.</li><li>The liquid should still cover most of the vegetables. A wide pan loses liquid quickly, so top up with a splash of hot water if it has dropped below half.</li></ul>",
