   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Slide in the tofu and the shrimp or clams. Simmer uncovered for <b>2–3 minutes</b>, until the shrimp turn pink or the clams open. Throw away any clams that stay shut.</li><li>Taste the broth. Too mild: press in another teaspoon of doenjang. Too salty: add a little hot water. Sprinkle in the gochugaru now if you want gentle warmth.</li></ul>",
